|    Event     |              Meaning                     |         Example          |
|--------------|------------------------------------------|--------------------------|
| `click`      | Kisi element par click karna             | Button click             |
| `dblclick`   | Double-click karna                       | Button par do baar click |
| `mouseover`  | Mouse ko element ke upar le jana         | Image par mouse le jana  |
| `mouseout`   | Mouse ko element se bahar le jana        | Image se mouse hatana    |
| `keydown`    | Keyboard ki key press karna              | A key press karna        |
| `keyup`      | Key release karna                        | A key chhorna            |
| `input`      | Input field ki value change hona         | Naam type karna          |
| `change`     | Input ya selection ki value change hona  | Dropdown select karna    |
| `submit`     | Form submit karna                        | Login form submit        |
| `load`       | Page ya resource load hona               | Page load complete hona  |